        "text": "Motor display: four green coil indicators, estimated shaft pointer (assumed 4096 half-steps/rev),\ngreen status bar=legal phase order; red=illegal/skipped phase. Hall follows rotor; switches disconnect Hall for fault injection.\nProduction serial: INIT POWER_OFF | ENABLE 10 | LIMIT 10 | ARM | HOME ALL | STATUS | TEXT HELLO | STOP"
